sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as Provider retries
    participant P2 as Callback handler
    participant P3 as Unique receipt/ref
    participant P4 as Compare-and-set status
    participant P5 as Anomaly/replay result
    P1->>P2: Receive callback
    P2->>P3: Validate provider payload
    P3->>P4: Insert unique receipt
    P4->>P5: Compare-and-set status
    P5-->>P1: Résultat / statut vérifié
